msgid ""
"You can upload files and share plain links with this OneDrive. Link expiry "
"and download passwords are not available on a free personal OneDrive (they "
"need a Microsoft 365 subscription), so both are turned off for this account."
msgstr ""
"Μπορείτε να μεταφορτώνετε αρχεία και να κοινοποιείτε απλούς συνδέσμους με "
